      "description": "A desktop table record becomes a readable, wrapping phone entry. Preview content is illustrative.",
      "html": "<table class=\"ds-ledger\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ds-link\"><button class=\"ds-link-title\" type=\"button\">Product documentation</button><a class=\"ds-address\" href=\"#details\">localhost:8001/docs-link</a><div class=\"ds-destination\">example.com/documentation</div></td><td><span class=\"ds-status-active\">Active</span></td><td class=\"ds-clicks\">12 <span>clicks</span></td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "css": ".ds-ledger{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#1d3028);font-family:var(--font,Manrope,Arial,sans-serif);}.ds-ledger td{padding:17px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9efeb;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;}.ds-ledger tr:hover{background:#fbfdfb;}.ds-link{min-width:170px;max-width:380px;}.ds-link-title{display:block;max-width:100%;padding:0;border:0;background:none;color:var(--ink,#1d3028);font-family:var(--font,Manrope,Arial,sans-serif);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.6;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}.ds-link-title:hover{color:var(--accent,#176448);}.ds-link-title:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#176448);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-address{display:inline-block;margin-top:5px;max-width:100%;color:var(--accent,#176448);font:10px/1.6 var(--mono,ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace);text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}.ds-address:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#176448);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-destination{margin-top:3px;color:var(--muted,#62716a);font-size:10px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}.ds-status-active{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:5px;background:#edf6ef;color:#28613c;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;}.ds-status-active::before{content:\"\";width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor;}.ds-clicks{font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-align:right;}.ds-clicks span{display:none;}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-ledger,.ds-ledger tbody{display:block;}.ds-ledger tr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto auto;align-items:center;gap:8px 16px;padding:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dce5df);}.ds-ledger td{padding:0;border:0;min-width:0;}.ds-link{grid-column:1/-1;max-width:none;}.ds-link-title{font-size:13px;white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-address,.ds-destination{font-size:11px;white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere;max-width:none;}.ds-status-active{font-size:11px;}.ds-clicks span{display:inline;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted,#62716a);}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Daily Click Chart",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Sage bars and a green latest day against dashed rules. Preview is a zero-data chart; live charts use API counts.",
      "html": "<svg class=\"ds-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 126\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Preview: zero clicks\"><path class=\"ds-grid\" d=\"M29 14H357M29 57H357M29 100H357\"/><text x=\"21\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"21\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><text x=\"21\" y=\"17\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mon</text><text x=\"98\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tue</text><text x=\"144\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wed</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Thu</text><text x=\"236\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fri</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sat</text><text class=\"ds-today\" x=\"328\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Sun</text></svg>",
      "css": ".ds-chart{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:180px;overflow:visible;}.ds-grid{fill:none;stroke:#e0e9e3;stroke-dasharray:3 4;}.ds-chart text{font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:9px;fill:#65766b;}.ds-chart .ds-today{fill:#176448;}.ds-chart rect{fill:#a9ceba;}.ds-chart rect:last-of-type,.ds-chart rect:hover{fill:var(--accent,#176448);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback Toast",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "toast",
      "description": "Polite transient feedback; the only surface with a drop shadow.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Short link copied. Ready to share.</div>",
      "css": ".ds-toast{display:inline-block;max-width:calc(100% - 32px);padding:12px 20px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--ink,#1d3028);color:#fff;font-family:var(--font,Manrope,Arial,sans-serif);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;box-shadow:0 6px 24px #153e2626;animation:ds-surface-in .2s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1));}@keyframes ds-surface-in{from{opacity:.75;translate:0 6px;}to{opacity:1;translate:0 0;}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-toast{animation:none;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A working link notebook",
    "overview": "White sheets sit on a cool pale-green desk. Green ink identifies actions, selected navigation, and short addresses; Manrope keeps the workspace clear and compact. Thin rules and stable alignment give the interface the feel of an orderly notebook.\n\nThe system supports repeated creation, scanning, and inspection. It uses restrained surface boundaries, direct labels, and brief state changes. The dashboard's particular composition is recorded in `.impeccable/surfaces/dashboard.md`; this document records the implemented visual vocabulary.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "White panels on a pale-green canvas.",
      "Green action ink and warm amber for paused links.",
      "Manrope for interface text; monospace for short addresses.",
      "Flat, bordered surfaces with compact desktop density.",
      "Readable stacked records on phones."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** reuse the green action palette, white sheets, and pale canvas.",
      "**Do** keep phone link titles and addresses readable with wrapping and the implemented 13px/11px sizes.",
      "**Do** preserve visible keyboard focus, focus restoration, and immediate reduced-motion updates.",
      "**Do** pair status colors with words and show real API values in charts and counts."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** add shadows to regular panels or use decorative gradients to separate sections.",
      "**Don't** squeeze the desktop table columns into a phone-width grid.",
      "**Don't** use monospace for navigation, headings, or supporting prose.",
      "**Don't** replace task controls or honest empty states with ornamental metric tiles or simulated chart data."
    ]
  }
}
